# Known non-commercial face assets -- tracked debt, not clearance.
#
# An asset listed here ships today and may not be shipped by a commercial product. It is carried
# loudly -- bin/face-licence-gate prints every line on every run -- and the list only ever shrinks:
# a new non-commercial asset is refused outright, never added here.
#
# The entry must match the asset's licence line in
# backstage/packages/app/public/face/VERSIONS exactly. Edit the asset or its record and the entry
# stops matching, so the debt has to be re-argued in review rather than inherited silently.
#
# When the asset is replaced, delete its line here in the same commit. A line naming an asset that
# is gone is itself a FAIL, so this file cannot rot into a permanent exemption.
#
#   recorded 2026-10-03 by the face lane (docs/specs/2026-10-03-face-experience-10x.md §1/§6)
